  <!-- EN: Drag the bar to set a level. The pilot will reload the resurrector whenever it falls below that level. -->
  <OLWC_GaugeDragHint>拖曳長條即可設定門檻。充能低於這個門檻時，駕駛員就會為復活器裝填。</OLWC_GaugeDragHint>

  <!-- Mod settings (Source/1.6/Settings/) -->
  <!-- EN: Overlord Warcasket -->
  <OLWC_SettingsCategory>霸主型戰棺</OLWC_SettingsCategory>
  <!-- EN: These settings are unavailable. Another mod has changed the overlord warcasket, so the set will keep its built-in values. -->
  <OLWC_SettingsUnavailable>這些設定目前無法使用。另一個模組修改了霸主型戰棺，因此這套戰棺會沿用內建數值。</OLWC_SettingsUnavailable>

  <!-- EN: Resurrect mech -->
  <OLWC_SectionResurrect>復活機械族</OLWC_SectionResurrect>

  <!-- EN: Charge capacity -->
  <OLWC_Charges>充能容量</OLWC_Charges>
  <!-- EN: The number of resurrection charges the armor holds when full. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_ChargesDesc>裝甲充滿時可儲存的復活充能數量。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_ChargesDesc>

  <!-- EN: Charges recharged per day -->
  <OLWC_ChargesPerDay>每天恢復的充能</OLWC_ChargesPerDay>
  <!-- EN: The number of charges the armor recharges on its own each day. At 0, it will only gain charges by reloading. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_ChargesPerDayDesc>裝甲每天自行恢復的充能數量。設為0時，只能靠裝填取得充能。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_ChargesPerDayDesc>

  <!-- EN: Reload cost per charge -->
  <OLWC_ReloadCost>每次充能的裝填花費</OLWC_ReloadCost>
  <!-- EN: The number of {1} it takes to reload one charge. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_ReloadCostDesc>裝填一次充能所需的{1}數量。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_ReloadCostDesc>

  <!-- EN: Maximum corpse age -->
  <OLWC_CorpseAge>死亡時間上限</OLWC_CorpseAge>
  <!-- EN: How long after a mech's death it can still be resurrected, in game time. At the highest setting, there will be no limit. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_CorpseAgeDesc>機械族死亡後仍可被復活的期限，以遊戲時間計算。調到最高時將沒有限制。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_CorpseAgeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Unlimited -->
  <OLWC_Unlimited>無限制</OLWC_Unlimited>

  <!-- EN: Casting time -->
  <OLWC_CastTime>施放時間</OLWC_CastTime>
  <!-- EN: How long the pilot takes to start a resurrection. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_CastTimeDesc>駕駛員開始一次復活所需的時間。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_CastTimeDesc>

  <!-- EN: Cooldown -->
  <OLWC_Cooldown>冷卻時間</OLWC_Cooldown>
  <!-- EN: The time the pilot must wait after a resurrection before starting another. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_CooldownDesc>駕駛員復活機械族後，必須等待這段時間才能再次復活。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_CooldownDesc>
  <!-- EN: Range -->
  <OLWC_Range>距離</OLWC_Range>
  <!-- EN: How close the pilot must be to the mech to start a resurrection, in cells. Line of sight is required. At the highest setting, the pilot can resurrect a mech anywhere on the map. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_RangeDesc>開始復活時，駕駛員與機械族之間所能相隔的最遠距離，以格計算。機械族必須位於駕駛員的視線內。調到最高時，駕駛員可以復活地圖上任何地方的機械族。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_RangeDesc>

  <!-- EN: Spark frequency -->
  <OLWC_SparkFrequency>火花頻率</OLWC_SparkFrequency>
  <!-- EN: How often your pilots' armor crackles with red sparks, where 100% is as often as an apocriton. At 0%, the armor will not spark at all. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_SparkFrequencyDesc>裝甲冒出紅色火花的頻率，100%與阿布機頓相同。設為0%時，裝甲完全不會冒出火花。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_SparkFrequencyDesc>

  <!-- EN: Require a mechlink -->
  <OLWC_RequireMechlink>需要機絆</OLWC_RequireMechlink>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, only a mechanitor pilot can use resurrect mech. When disabled, any pilot can resurrect your mechs. -->
  <OLWC_RequireMechlinkDesc>啟用時，只有身為御機使的駕駛員能使用「復活機械族」。停用時，任何駕駛員都能復活你的機械族。</OLWC_RequireMechlinkDesc>

  <!-- EN: Sparks only while drafted -->
  <OLWC_SparksOnlyDrafted>僅在徵召時冒出火花</OLWC_SparksOnlyDrafted>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, your pilots' armor will only crackle with red sparks while drafted and able to resurrect mechs. When disabled, the armor will spark whenever it holds a charge, as an apocriton does. -->
  <OLWC_SparksOnlyDraftedDesc>啟用時，駕駛員的裝甲只會在受徵召且能夠復活機械族時冒出紅色火花。停用時，只要儲有充能，裝甲就會像阿布機頓一樣冒出火花。</OLWC_SparksOnlyDraftedDesc>

  <!-- EN: {1} for {0_indefinite} mech -->
  <OLWC_SummaryCost>{0_indefinite}機械族需{1}次</OLWC_SummaryCost>
  <!-- EN: recharges {0} of them each day -->
  <OLWC_SummaryRegen>每天恢復{0}次</OLWC_SummaryRegen>
  <!-- EN: never recharges -->
  <OLWC_SummaryNoRegen>不會自行恢復</OLWC_SummaryNoRegen>
  <!-- EN: {0}, and each one can be reloaded with {1} -->
  <OLWC_SummaryReload>{0}，每次充能也可用{1}裝填</OLWC_SummaryReload>
  <!-- EN: as long as it died within the last {0} -->
  <OLWC_SummaryWindow>但只限{0}內死亡的機械族</OLWC_SummaryWindow>
  <!-- EN: no matter how long ago it died -->
  <OLWC_SummaryNoWindow>不論機械族已死亡多久</OLWC_SummaryNoWindow>
  <!-- EN: The armor holds up to {0} charges and {1}. Resurrecting a mech costs {2}, {3}. Resurrection takes {4} to cast, and the cooldown after is {5}. -->
  <OLWC_ResurrectSummary>裝甲最多可儲存{0}次充能，{1}。復活機械族時，{2}，{3}。施放復活需要{4}，之後的冷卻時間為{5}。</OLWC_ResurrectSummary>
  <!-- EN: The armor holds up to {0} charges and {1}. Resurrecting a mech costs {2}, {3}. Resurrection takes {4} to cast, and the next can start at once. -->
  <OLWC_ResurrectSummaryNoCooldown>裝甲最多可儲存{0}次充能，{1}。復活機械族時，{2}，{3}。施放復活需要{4}，下一次復活可以立即開始。</OLWC_ResurrectSummaryNoCooldown>

  <!-- Mech stun pulse (Source/1.6/Comps/CompMechStunPulse.cs, Source/1.6/Settings/StunPulseSetting.cs). The _<choice> keys end in a StunPulseTrigger name. -->
  <!-- EN: Mech stun pulse -->
  <OLWC_SectionStunPulse>機械族暈眩脈衝</OLWC_SectionStunPulse>
  <!-- EN: When an apocriton dies, it releases a pulse that stuns the mechs around it. The armor releases the same pulse when its pilot falls, and it will stun your own mechs as well as hostile ones. -->
  <OLWC_SectionStunPulseDesc>阿布機頓死亡時會發出脈衝，使周圍的機械族暈眩。駕駛員倒下時，裝甲也會發出同樣的脈衝，不只敵方機械族，你自己的機械族也會跟著暈眩。</OLWC_SectionStunPulseDesc>

  <!-- EN: Triggered when -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseTrigger>觸發時機</OLWC_StunPulseTrigger>
  <!-- EN: What must happen to the pilot for the armor to release its pulse. -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseTriggerDesc>裝甲會在駕駛員發生哪種狀況時發出脈衝。</OLWC_StunPulseTriggerDesc>
  <!-- EN: The pilot dies -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_Death>駕駛員死亡時</OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_Death>
  <!-- EN: The armor will release its pulse when the pilot dies, as an apocriton does. -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_DeathDesc>駕駛員死亡時，裝甲會像阿布機頓一樣發出脈衝。</OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_DeathDesc>
  <!-- EN: The pilot is downed -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_Downed>駕駛員倒地時</OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_Downed>
  <!-- EN: The armor will release its pulse each time the pilot is downed, but not when they die. -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_DownedDesc>駕駛員每次倒地時，裝甲都會發出脈衝，但駕駛員死亡時不會。</OLWC_StunPulseTrigger_DownedDesc>

  <!-- EN: Pulse radius -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseRadius>脈衝範圍</OLWC_StunPulseRadius>
  <!-- EN: How far the pulse reaches from the pilot, in cells. Walls will block it. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseRadiusDesc>脈衝從駕駛員身上向外擴散的距離，以格計算。牆壁會擋住脈衝。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_StunPulseRadiusDesc>

  <!-- EN: When the pilot dies, the armor stuns every mech within {0} cells for {1}, including your own. -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseSummary_Death>駕駛員死亡時，裝甲會使{0}格內的所有機械族暈眩{1}，連你自己的機械族也不例外。</OLWC_StunPulseSummary_Death>
  <!-- EN: When the pilot is downed, the armor stuns every mech within {0} cells for {1}, including your own. -->
  <OLWC_StunPulseSummary_Downed>駕駛員倒地時，裝甲會使{0}格內的所有機械族暈眩{1}，連你自己的機械族也不例外。</OLWC_StunPulseSummary_Downed>

  <!-- EN: Enabled work types -->
  <OLWC_SectionWork>已啟用的工作類型</OLWC_SectionWork>
  <!-- EN: The work an overlord pilot can do. All other work follows VFE Pirates' warcasket rules, so mods that change those rules will change them for the overlord too. -->
  <OLWC_SectionWorkDesc>霸主型戰棺駕駛員可以從事的工作。其他所有工作都依照VFE Pirates的戰棺規則，因此若有模組修改這些規則，霸主型也會跟著改變。</OLWC_SectionWorkDesc>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, overlord pilots can do this work, though you will need to assign it in the work tab. When disabled, they cannot. -->
  <OLWC_WorkDesc>啟用時，霸主型戰棺駕駛員可以從事這項工作，但需要在「工作」面板中自行分配。停用時則無法從事。</OLWC_WorkDesc>
  <!-- EN: Hacking is research work, and a mechanitor needs the same skill to study the chips that unlock mechtech research. A pilot who cannot research will be unable to do either. -->
  <OLWC_WorkNote_Research>破解屬於研究工作，御機使研究解鎖機械科技研究的晶片時，也需要同一項技能。無法從事研究的駕駛員，兩者都做不到。</OLWC_WorkNote_Research>
  <!-- EN: Mech gestation, subcore encoding, mech repair and shredding mechanoids at a machining table are smithing work. -->
  <OLWC_WorkNote_Smithing>培養機械族、次核心編碼、修理機械族，以及在機械加工桌拆解機械族，都屬於鍛造工作。</OLWC_WorkNote_Smithing>
  <!-- EN: Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_WorkDefault>預設值：{0}。</OLWC_WorkDefault>
  <!-- EN: enabled -->
  <OLWC_WorkOpen>啟用</OLWC_WorkOpen>
  <!-- EN: disabled -->
  <OLWC_WorkBlocked>停用</OLWC_WorkBlocked>
  <!-- EN: The pilot can take on {0} work. All other work follows VFE Pirates' warcasket rules. -->
  <OLWC_WorkSummary>駕駛員可以擔任{0}。其他所有工作都依照VFE Pirates的戰棺規則。</OLWC_WorkSummary>
  <!-- EN: The pilot takes on none of this work. All other work follows VFE Pirates' warcasket rules. -->
  <OLWC_WorkSummaryNone>駕駛員不從事這些工作。其他所有工作都依照VFE Pirates的戰棺規則。</OLWC_WorkSummaryNone>

  <!-- Mechanitor command range (Source/1.6/CommandRange/, Source/1.6/Settings/CommandRangeSetting.cs) -->
  <!-- EN: Mechanitor command range -->
  <OLWC_SectionCommandRange>御機使指揮範圍</OLWC_SectionCommandRange>
  <!-- EN: Normally, a mechanitor's drafted mechs can only be ordered to within {0} cells of the mechanitor. These settings let mechanitors command their mechs from further away. -->
  <OLWC_SectionCommandRangeDesc>一般情況下，受徵召的機械族只能被指揮到御機使周圍{0}格以內。這些設定能讓御機使從更遠的地方指揮機械族。</OLWC_SectionCommandRangeDesc>

  <!-- EN: Applies to -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeAppliesTo>適用對象</OLWC_CommandRangeAppliesTo>
  <!-- EN: Which mechanitors get the extended command range. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeAppliesToDesc>哪些御機使能獲得延伸的指揮範圍。</OLWC_CommandRangeAppliesToDesc>
  <!-- EN: Mechanitors wearing the {0} -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeWearing>穿戴{0}的御機使</OLWC_CommandRangeWearing>
  <!-- EN: Only mechanitors wearing the {0} will get the extended command range. Everyone else will keep the normal range. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeWearingDesc>只有穿戴{0}的御機使能獲得延伸的指揮範圍，其他人會維持一般範圍。</OLWC_CommandRangeWearingDesc>
  <!-- EN: All mechanitors -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeAllMechanitors>所有御機使</OLWC_CommandRangeAllMechanitors>
  <!-- EN: Every mechanitor will get the extended command range, whatever they are wearing. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeAllMechanitorsDesc>無論穿戴什麼，每位御機使都能獲得延伸的指揮範圍。</OLWC_CommandRangeAllMechanitorsDesc>
  <!-- EN: No one -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeNone>無</OLWC_CommandRangeNone>
  <!-- EN: Mechanitors will keep the normal command range of {0} cells. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeNoneDesc>御機使會維持{0}格的一般指揮範圍。</OLWC_CommandRangeNoneDesc>

  <!-- EN: Command range -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeScope>指揮範圍</OLWC_CommandRangeScope>
  <!-- EN: How far from their mechanitor drafted mechs can be ordered to move or attack. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeScopeDesc>御機使能命令受徵召的機械族移動或攻擊到多遠的地方。</OLWC_CommandRangeScopeDesc>
  <!-- EN: Anywhere on the same map -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeCurrentMap>同一張地圖上的任何地方</OLWC_CommandRangeCurrentMap>
  <!-- EN: Drafted mechs can be ordered anywhere on their map, as long as their mechanitor is on the same map. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeCurrentMapDesc>只要御機使在同一張地圖上，受徵召的機械族就能被指揮到該地圖上的任何地方。</OLWC_CommandRangeCurrentMapDesc>
  <!-- EN: Anywhere -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeAnywhere>任何地方</OLWC_CommandRangeAnywhere>
  <!-- EN: Mechs can be drafted and ordered anywhere, even if their mechanitor is on another map or traveling in a caravan. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeAnywhereDesc>即使御機使在另一張地圖上，或正隨旅隊移動，也能徵召並指揮機械族。</OLWC_CommandRangeAnywhereDesc>
  <!-- EN: Within {0} cells{1} -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeRadius>{0}格以內{1}</OLWC_CommandRangeRadius>
  <!-- EN: Drafted mechs can be ordered to within this distance of their mechanitor. The normal range is {0} cells. Default: {1} cells. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeRadiusDesc>受徵召的機械族能被指揮到離御機使這段距離以內的地方。一般範圍為{0}格。預設值：{1}格。</OLWC_CommandRangeRadiusDesc>
  <!-- EN:  (vanilla) -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeVanillaSuffix>(原版)</OLWC_CommandRangeVanillaSuffix>
  <!-- EN:  (Combat Extended) -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeCombatExtendedSuffix>(Combat Extended)</OLWC_CommandRangeCombatExtendedSuffix>
  <!-- EN: Moving the slider will select this range. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeSliderSelects>移動滑桿就會選擇這個範圍。</OLWC_CommandRangeSliderSelects>
  <!-- EN: This has no effect while the extended command range applies to no one. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeInert>延伸指揮範圍不適用於任何人時，這項設定沒有作用。</OLWC_CommandRangeInert>

  <!-- EN: Mechanitors keep the normal command range of {0} cells. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeSummaryNone>御機使保持{0}格的一般指揮範圍。</OLWC_CommandRangeSummaryNone>
  <!-- EN: Mechanitors wearing the {0} can order their drafted mechs {1}. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeSummaryWearing>穿戴{0}的御機使可以將受徵召的機械族指揮到{1}。</OLWC_CommandRangeSummaryWearing>
  <!-- EN: Every mechanitor can order their drafted mechs {0}. -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeSummaryAll>每位御機使都可以將受徵召的機械族指揮到{0}。</OLWC_CommandRangeSummaryAll>
  <!-- EN: anywhere on the same map -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeReachMap>同一張地圖上的任何地方</OLWC_CommandRangeReachMap>
  <!-- EN: anywhere, even on another map -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeReachAnywhere>任何地方，即使是另一張地圖</OLWC_CommandRangeReachAnywhere>
  <!-- EN: to within {0} cells -->
  <OLWC_CommandRangeReachRadius>{0}格以內</OLWC_CommandRangeReachRadius>

  <!-- Cerebrex node art, shown with Odyssey only (Source/1.6/Settings/CerebrexArtSetting.cs, CerebrexNode.cs; the choice picks a branch of 1.6/Mods/Odyssey/Patches/CerebrexNodeArt.xml). The _<choice> keys end in a CerebrexArt name. -->
  <!-- EN: Cerebrex node -->
  <OLWC_SectionCerebrex>超智腦節點</OLWC_SectionCerebrex>
  <!-- EN: Cerebrex node art -->
  <OLWC_CerebrexArt>超智腦節點美術</OLWC_CerebrexArt>
  <!-- EN: The art used for Odyssey's cerebrex node. The new art is higher resolution, and you can choose how much of it a dye will color. Default: {0}. -->
  <OLWC_CerebrexArtDesc>「漫遊」超智腦節點使用的美術。新美術的解析度更高，還能選擇染料要為哪些部位上色。預設值：{0}。</OLWC_CerebrexArtDesc>
  <!-- EN: Odyssey's art -->
  <OLWC_CerebrexArt_Odyssey>「漫遊」的美術</OLWC_CerebrexArt_Odyssey>
  <!-- EN: The cerebrex node will keep Odyssey's own art. -->
  <OLWC_CerebrexArt_OdysseyDesc>超智腦節點會保留「漫遊」原本的美術。</OLWC_CerebrexArt_OdysseyDesc>
  <!-- EN: New art, fully dyed -->
  <OLWC_CerebrexArt_DyeAll>新美術，整體染色</OLWC_CerebrexArt_DyeAll>
  <!-- EN: Dye will color the whole node, as it does with Odyssey's art. -->
  <OLWC_CerebrexArt_DyeAllDesc>染料會為整個節點上色，和「漫遊」的美術一樣。</OLWC_CerebrexArt_DyeAllDesc>
  <!-- EN: New art, dyed frame -->
  <OLWC_CerebrexArt_DyeFrame>新美術，框架染色</OLWC_CerebrexArt_DyeFrame>
  <!-- EN: Dye will only color the frame. The ring and the core will keep their own colors. -->
